    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperbly presented throughout, this impressive newly renovated four-bedroom detached residence is situated within the prestigious Old Quarter development in the heart of Ballincollig. Offering an excellent balance of generous living and bedroom accommodation, this B-rated home combines contemporary finishes with an exceptionally convenient location, making it an ideal family home.\nThe accommodation is bright, spacious and thoughtfully arranged over three floors. On the ground floor, a beautifully presented reception room is positioned to the front of the property, providing an inviting and comfortable living space.\nTo the rear lies the real heart of the home a stunning open-plan kitchen and dining room incorporating a split-level living area. Designed with both everyday family life and entertaining in mind, this impressive space opens directly onto the west-facing landscaped rear garden and superb patio, creating a wonderful connection between the indoor and outdoor areas.\nThe beautifully appointed kitchen, features an excellent range of fitted cabinetry complemented by premium Miele appliances, a striking Madreperla quartz worktop and matching splashback. A generous utility room, also fitted with Miele appliances, provides additional storage and functionality, while a large guest WC completes the ground-floor accommodation.\nOn the first floor are two particularly generous double bedrooms, both of which benefit from their own en-suite bathrooms. The top floor provides a further two bedrooms together with the main family bathroom, creating excellent flexibility for growing families, guests or those requiring dedicated home-working space.\nExternally, the property is equally impressive. To the front a cobble-lock driveway provides convenient off-street parking for two vehicles. To the rear, the beautifully landscaped west-facing garden enjoys excellent afternoon and evening sunshine, with a substantial patio providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining and entertaining.\nThe location is difficult to surpass. Ballincollig town centre is within approximately a two-minute walk, offering an extensive selection of shops, supermarkets, cafés, bars, restaurants, cinema and sporting facilities. A 24-hour bus service is conveniently available directly outside the development, providing excellent connectivity.\nThe property also enjoys direct access to the highly regarded network of local walkways leading towards Ballincollig Regional Park, offering an exceptional amenity virtually on the doorstep.\nCombining a superb standard of finish, generous accommodation, a west-facing garden and an outstanding central location, this is a truly impressive family home in one of Ballincollig's most sought-after developments."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superb newly renovated four-bedroom detached B-rated family home within the prestigious Old Quarter development. </li><li>Bright and spacious accommodation thoughtfully arranged over three floors, including four generous bedrooms and three bathrooms. </li><li>Stunning open-plan kitchen/dining room with split-level living area, featuring premium Miele appliances, stone worktops and splashback. </li><li>Beautifully landscaped west-facing rear garden and patio, ideal for outdoor dining and entertaining. </li><li>Cobble-lock driveway with off-street parking for two cars </li><li>Exceptional location just a two-minute walk from Ballincollig town centre, with a 24-hour bus service and direct access to walkways leading to Ballincollig Regional Park.</ul>"
      },
